      "exploration-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727": {
        "id": "exploration-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727",
        "title": "ETag Validation: 304 and Resource Changes",
        "summary": "ETag validation: browser sends If-None-Match, server returns 304 with headers only if unchanged so browser reuses cache, or 200 with new body and ETag if changed.",
        "parentId": "root",
        "source": {
          "explorationId": "root",
          "messageId": "answer-smoke-faeb4636-350f-483a-bde8-c624fdbb54a8",
          "sectionId": "section-smoke-faeb4636-350f-483a-bde8-c624fdbb54a8-0",
          "quote": "Server previously sent ETag: \"abc123\" or Last-Modified."
        },
        "messages": [
          {
            "id": "question-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727",
            "role": "user",
            "requestId": "smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727",
            "source": {
              "explorationId": "root",
              "messageId": "answer-smoke-faeb4636-350f-483a-bde8-c624fdbb54a8",
              "sectionId": "section-smoke-faeb4636-350f-483a-bde8-c624fdbb54a8-0",
              "quote": "Server previously sent ETag: \"abc123\" or Last-Modified."
            },
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "prompt-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727",
                "title": "",
                "body": "Walk me through ETag validation in depth: 304 responses, what happens when the resource changes, and a complete request/response example."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "answer-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727",
            "role": "assistant",
            "requestId": "smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727",
            "source": {
              "explorationId": "root",
              "messageId": "answer-smoke-faeb4636-350f-483a-bde8-c624fdbb54a8",
              "sectionId": "section-smoke-faeb4636-350f-483a-bde8-c624fdbb54a8-0",
              "quote": "Server previously sent ETag: \"abc123\" or Last-Modified."
            },
            "routing": {
              "decision": "branch",
              "reason": "This is a focused deep-dive on ETag validation worth keeping as its own topic."
            },
            "model": "muse-spark-1.3",
            "context": {
              "fullIds": [
                "root"
              ],
              "summaryIds": [],
              "truncated": false
            },
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "section-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727-0",
                "title": "How ETag validation works",
                "body": "**Initial store:** Server sends a strong validator for a version of the resource:\n```http\nETag: \"abc123\"\n```\nBrowser caches both body + ETag.\n\n**Revalidation trigger:** Cache is stale (`max-age` expired), or response had `Cache-Control: no-cache`, or user forced reload.\n\n**Conditional request:** Browser sends:\n```http\nIf-None-Match: \"abc123\"\n```\nThis means: only send me full body if version no longer matches."
              },
              {
                "id": "section-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727-1",
                "title": "304 responses vs changed resource",
                "body": "**1. Unchanged -> 304 Not Modified**\n- Server compares `If-None-Match` to current ETag.\n- Match = client copy still good.\n- Server responds with headers only, no body:\n```http\nHTTP/1.1 304 Not Modified\nETag: \"abc123\"\nCache-Control: max-age=60\n```\n- Browser reuses cached body, updates freshness timers.\n- Saves bandwidth and is fast.\n\n**2. Changed -> 200 OK**\n- ETags differ, e.g. current is `\"def456\"`.\n- Server ignores condition and sends full new representation:\n```http\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nETag: \"def456\"\nContent-Length: 18432\n```\n- Browser replaces cached body + ETag.\n\n`Last-Modified / If-Modified-Since` works similarly, but is second-precision and weaker. `If-None-Match` takes precedence if both sent."
              },
              {
                "id": "section-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727-2",
                "title": "Complete request/response example",
                "body": "**1. First fetch:**\n```http\nGET /logo.png HTTP/1.1\nHost: example.com\n```\n```http\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nCache-Control: max-age=60\nETag: \"v1\"\nContent-Length: 12345\n[binary body]\n```\n\n**2. 70 seconds later (stale):**\n```http\nGET /logo.png HTTP/1.1\nHost: example.com\nIf-None-Match: \"v1\"\n```\n\n**3a. If unchanged:**\n```http\nHTTP/1.1 304 Not Modified\nETag: \"v1\"\nCache-Control: max-age=60\n```\nBrowser renders from cache.\n\n**3b. If changed on server:**\n```http\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nETag: \"v2\"\nCache-Control: max-age=60\nContent-Length: 13456\n[new binary body]\n```\nBrowser replaces cache entry with `v2`.\n\nCurrent verification needed for weak `W/\"...\"` and custom server logic details."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "question-smoke-32079dd5-8348-4a3b-9159-5606532c55c2",
            "role": "user",
            "requestId": "smoke-32079dd5-8348-4a3b-9159-5606532c55c2",
            "source": null,
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "prompt-smoke-32079dd5-8348-4a3b-9159-5606532c55c2",
                "title": "",
                "body": "Quick clarification: does a 304 response normally include the full representation body? Answer in one short section."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "answer-smoke-32079dd5-8348-4a3b-9159-5606532c55c2",
            "role": "assistant",
            "requestId": "smoke-32079dd5-8348-4a3b-9159-5606532c55c2",
            "source": null,
            "routing": {
              "decision": "continue",
              "reason": "Quick clarification within the existing ETag/304 topic."
            },
            "model": "muse-spark-1.3",
            "context": {
              "fullIds": [
                "exploration-smoke-338a10cf-62d8-4390-b553-fe9a630ca727",
                "root"
              ],
              "summaryIds": [],
              "truncated": false
            },
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "section-smoke-32079dd5-8348-4a3b-9159-5606532c55c2-0",
                "title": "304 has no body",
                "body": "No. A `304 Not Modified` normally has **headers only, no body**.\n\nThe browser reuses its cached body and uses the 304 headers to update `ETag` and freshness like `Cache-Control: max-age=...`."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
